# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# react-router uses real paths (/maldi, /prediction, /ir, ...). Without this,
# a hard refresh or deep link to one of those returns Pages' 404 because no
# matching file exists. Rewrite every unmatched path to index.html (200, not a
# redirect) so the client-side router takes over. Real asset files are served
# directly and never reach this rule.
/*    /index.html   200
